  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcGauges .NET: radial and linear gauges (bar, thermometer, bullet), 7 segment digital display, LED, LED bar and progress ring in WinForms, WPF and Avalonia, with ranges, thresholds, animation, themes and headless PNG and SVG output. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. Additional scales and pointers, the 14 segment and dot matrix displays, the VU meter, clock, compass and annunciator gauges are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
